# All optional. Set these in the shell running the API, the pipeline or the export command.
# Scene the API and marcaj-judge read (default: data/generated/scene.json), an EPSG:32635 FeatureCollection.
# MARCAJ_SCENE_PATH=/absolute/path/to/scene.json
# Folder holding the unzipped organizer package (default: data/raw/marcaj).
# MARCAJ_DATA_DIR=/absolute/path/to/marcaj
# App-only point status log (default: data/app/point_status.json).
# MARCAJ_STATUS_PATH=/absolute/path/to/point_status.json
# Telegram bot token (marcaj.telegram_bot): in Telegram, send /newbot to @BotFather and paste the token it returns. Never commit it.
# TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=
